From 71fb363ecc2a74b6d925a7e5b195498bd0f58eb4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dai <dai623815825@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 23:41:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] arm64/rk3576: add rptun/RPMsg AMP-slave backend

Static resource table + rptun ops for the RK3576 AMP slave talking to the
Linux master (rockchip_rpmsg_softirq). REMOTE role, fixed vrings at
0x47800000/0x47808000 (64 desc, NS-only features), notify via GICD_ISPENDR
(INTID 173), rx kick on INTID 172. Identity addrenv (flat-mapped shmem).
